      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also Japanese and for the past week I have been experiencing timeouts when I try to connect to the world, I can log in but cannot connect to the world.\n\nThis started happening suddenly about a week ago.\n\nIn my environment this symptom occurs in both VR mode and desktop mode (quest2).\n\nTo the best of my knowledge, there have been no changes to the software or hardware since before the timeouts started occurring, and if there were any changes, they would be automatic updates to Windows and steam.\n\nI have seen some reports on social networking sites that this problem has been resolved by using a VPN, but I have not tried that yet.\n\nI'll give it a few more days and if it doesn't work, I'll probably try using a VPN to connect.\n\nI am very surprised that all of a sudden this started happening.\n\nIs there some update on the VRC side that I'm just not aware of, or is there some specification that has been updated that requires additional work on the connection method?\n\n(This text is being translated by a translator)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
